# Unblessed: `:fix` Fix and Continue between Pumps (#444); first blessing awaits human review.
# `:fix` (ADR 0072): its refusals before any Host Input, a Rewind that does
# nothing on a suspended Run, then a Rewind of a Run `, queued` parked, which
# reloads with the mailbox kept, so its message runs again on the new code.
# A `:fix` whose Reload fails still rewinds, and the message runs again on the
# code it had.
> :mock api.later suspending
> :clock virtual 2026-09-30T10:00:00Z
> script variable n = 0
> on tick, queued
|   add 1 to n
|   ask api to later and wait
|   say "tick " & n
| end tick
> send tick to session
[session/r2] call session/r2.c1 api.later []
> send tick to session
> :runs
session/r2 suspended tick ask-wait session/r2.c1
session/r4 parked tick
> :fix
! bad arguments
> :fix session/r4 a b
! bad arguments
> :fix session/r4
! bad arguments
> :fix session/r4
| say "no"
! unexpected token at 1:1
> :fix session/r1
| on tick
| end tick
! no such run
> :fix session/r2
| on tick
| end tick
! not rewindable
> :fix session/r4
| script variable n = 10
| --| Says the count, then waits.
| on tick, queued
|   add 10 to n
|   say "fixed " & n
|   ask api to later and wait
| end tick
! rewound session/r4
! discarded session/r2
[session/r5] fixed 11
[session/r5] call session/r5.c2 api.later []
> :runs
session/r5 suspended tick ask-wait session/r5.c2
> :vars
n = 11
> send tick to session
> :fix session/r7
| on tick, queued
|   say missing
| end tick
! rewound session/r7
! unknown name at session:3:7
> :runs
session/r5 suspended tick ask-wait session/r5.c2
session/r8 parked tick
> :vars
n = 11
> :export
script variable n = 10
--| Says the count, then waits.
on tick, queued
  add 10 to n
  say "fixed " & n
  ask api to later and wait
end tick
